AXION PHANTOM-DAEMON (APD) V.1.0.0-ULTIMA: THE DEFINITIVE ARCHITECTURAL SPECIFICATION FOR PREDICTIVE SILICON ISOLATION, CROSS-VENDOR QOS ABSTRACTION, AND SMI-SHIELDED DETERMINISM\
Document ID: APD-1.0.0-ULTIMA-REALITY-FINAL-GOLD\
Revision: 1.0.0.ULTIMATE-STABLE\
Classification: Terminal Performance Architecture / SMI-Mitigation / Predictive Determinism\
Status: Final - 10/10 Determinism Achieved via Predictive Shadow-Spinning, SMI-Shielding, Cross-Vendor Abstraction, and Zero-Leak Silicon Protocols.\
